+# VibraPilot v1.0.6.23 — Vib Tools Browser Automation Desktop
+
+## v1.0.6.23 — PR-06 Workflow State Persistence and Atomic Switch/Restart
+
+VibraPilot now persists one validated active built-in workflow in `AppData/workflow_state.json`. Existing installations migrate once to `share_invite`; corrupt, unsupported or unknown persisted workflow state fails closed instead of silently falling back.
+
+A real workflow change is handled as an atomic transaction: same-workflow requests are no-ops, running/manual-review Tasks block switching, the user confirms before mutation, idle workers settle, approved workflow-scoped runtime state is staged for rollback and cleared, the new workflow state is atomically committed, and restart is requested only after commit. Global settings, licensing/device identity, browser profiles/settings and exported Reports/FailedData/Logs are preserved. PR-06 adds no Workflow page or second production workflow.
 
