+## v1.0.6.23 — PR-06 Workflow State Persistence + Atomic Switch / Restart — 2026-08-10
+
+Added schema-v1 active-workflow persistence and a fail-closed atomic switch/restart transaction. Existing users migrate to `share_invite` only when no workflow-state file exists; existing corrupt/unknown state does not silently default. Real switches block on running or manual-review Tasks, stage rollback state, clear only the owner-approved workflow-scoped runtime/input data, atomically commit the new workflow state, and restart once after commit. Global app/browser settings, licensing/device identity, browser profiles and exported Reports/FailedData/Logs are preserved.
+
 ## v1.0.6.22 — PR-05 Master Workflow Gate — 2026-08-10
 
 PR-05 introduces one in-memory Master Workflow execution gate. `AutomationWorker` resolves the active built-in workflow through `WorkflowManager`, while existing Share Invite compatibility methods route session verification, item execution and safe retry preparation through the resolved runtime. Invalid/missing workflows fail closed with no silent Share Invite fallback.
